                            SPIDER BURROW
|YK0================================================================|YKB

'The trapdoor spider is an ingenious creature able to bury
itself in foliage to create the illusion of invisibility.'|WK0 - |RKB
Ultimate Master Li Cek 
|YK0
In forest terrain, a Monk may lie in the underbrush pulling
surrounding refuse over their body and hide from those who
would wish to attack them.

|MK0This is a Disciple rank power.|YK0

